// The material table: one entry per material, shared by rendering, physics
// and audio. Hot-reloads on save; a bad table is rejected as a whole and the
// last good table stays live.
//
// Ids are stored in voxels and saves: never renumber or reuse one. 0 is air.
// Ranges: color channels 0.0..=1.0 (sRGB), roughness 0.0..=1.0,
// emission 0.0..=100.0 (relative to the sun), density_kg_m3 1.0..=25000.0,
// strength 0.0..=1000.0, friction 0.0..=2.0, restitution 0.0..=1.0.
